      "writtenOn": "2020-09-17T21:37:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Perhaps it should return NULL here?  We don\u0027t need to re-discover the failed mode most likely, so it\u0027s not really a next one to discover. \n\nAbe would know best, but I would guess perhaps the existing \"if\" check should just be \"if !\u003d NEEDED\" and then we need to hope users of said modes check their discovery status correctly.",
      "range": {
